<tr><th>#</th><th>Kind</th><th>Hex says</th><th>On screen</th><th>Answers, keys or blocks (✔ = right)</th><th>Result panel</th></tr>
<tr><td>0</td><td>Quiz, rows</td><td>You have ₹50. Your friend gives you ₹30. How much now?</td><td>WalletScene: ₹50 with a "+ ₹30" pill; the total ₹80 shows after 1.3 s only once answered right.<br>Option pictures: the coins picture on every option.</td><td>₹70<br><span class="ok">✔ ₹80</span><br>₹20</td><td>Right panel "Exactly!": 50 + 30 = 80. Addition combines values.<br>Wrong panel "Not quite": The money joins what you already have.</td></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Quiz, rows</td><td>Now you spend ₹20. How much is left?</td><td>WalletScene: ₹80 with a "- ₹20" pill; total ₹60 only after a right answer.<br>Option pictures: the coins picture on every option.</td><td>₹100<br><span class="ok">✔ ₹60</span><br>₹80</td><td>Right panel "Exactly!": 80 - 20 = 60. Subtraction finds the difference or what remains.<br>Wrong panel "Not quite": Spending takes money out of the wallet.</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>Quiz, rows</td><td>You have 12 stickers and get 5 more. Which operation finds the total?</td><td>No picture.<br>Option pictures: neutral icons.</td><td><span class="ok">✔ Add (+)</span><br>Subtract (-)<br>Divide (/)</td><td>Right panel "Right!": Addition combines values.<br>Wrong panel "Not quite": You are getting more. Do the stickers join or go away?</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>Quiz, rows</td><td>You have 9 sweets and eat 4. Which operation finds how many are left?</td><td>No picture.<br>Option pictures: neutral icons.</td><td>Multiply (*)<br><span class="ok">✔ Subtract (-)</span><br>Add (+)</td><td>Right panel "Right!": Subtraction finds what remains.<br>Wrong panel "Not quite": Eating takes sweets away.</td></tr>
</table>


