<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>Kind</th><th>Hex says</th><th>On screen</th><th>Answers, keys or blocks (✔ = right)</th><th>Result panel</th></tr>
<tr><td>0</td><td>Quiz, 2 x 2 tiles</td><td>Is your teacher older than you?</td><td>Versus (above).<br>Option pictures: icon-goal.svg and icon-short.svg.</td><td><span class="ok">✔ Yes.</span><br>No.</td><td>Right panel "Yes!": “My teacher is older than me” is correct. So the statement is True.<br>Wrong panel "Not quite": Compare the two ages on the cards.</td></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Quiz, 2 x 2 tiles</td><td>“My age is greater than my teacher's age.” Is that correct?</td><td>Versus (above).<br>Option pictures: icon-goal.svg and icon-short.svg.</td><td>Yes.<br><span class="ok">✔ No.</span></td><td>Right panel "No!": The statement is incorrect. So it is False. We compare things and decide if a statement is correct.<br>Wrong panel "Not quite": Is 13 greater than 35?</td></tr>
</table>


