<tr><td>4</td><td>Quiz, rows</td><td>Read this one.</td><td>15 &gt; 10<br>Option pictures: neutral icons.</td><td>Fifteen is less than ten.<br>Ten is greater than fifteen.<br><span class="ok">✔ Fifteen is greater than ten.</span></td><td>Right panel "Exactly!": “Fifteen is greater than ten.”<br>Wrong panel "Not quite": Start with 15, the number on the left.</td></tr>
