<tr><th>#</th><th>Kind</th><th>Hex says</th><th>On screen</th><th>Answers, keys or blocks (✔ = right)</th><th>Result panel</th></tr>
<tr><td>0</td><td>Quiz, rows</td><td>How many complete groups of 10 students can we form? 32 // 10 = ?</td><td>TripFacts.<br>Option pictures: neutral icons.</td><td><span class="ok">✔ 3</span><br>3.2<br>4</td><td>Right panel "Exactly!": 32 // 10 = 3 complete groups.<br>Wrong panel "Not quite": // counts complete groups only.</td></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Quiz, rows</td><td>How many students remain? 32 % 10 = ?</td><td>TripFacts.<br>Option pictures: neutral icons.</td><td><span class="ok">✔ 2</span><br>3<br>10</td><td>Right panel "Exactly!": 32 % 10 = 2 students remain.<br>Wrong panel "Not quite": % gives what is left after the complete groups.</td></tr>
