<h2>9. Timing and constants cheat sheet</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>What</th><th>Value</th></tr>
<tr><td>Design frame, scale</td><td>390 x 844; <code>min(w/390, h/844, 1.5)</code>; column <code>min(stageW - 50/scale, 380/scale)</code> (340)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Headline</td><td>spring 140/16, delay 0.15 s, from y -24; 28 px if 20 letters or fewer else 24 px; two lines above 25 letters; body starts at 125 (one line) or 163 (two)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Answer rows / tiles enter</td><td>opacity 0.3 s, y spring 110/13, delay 0.3 s, from y 90</td></tr>
<tr><td>Result panel</td><td>spring 360/32 (also drives the rise of rows 150 / tiles 180, the body padding 215 for an interaction panel, and Hex)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Body padding change</td><td>500 ms ease-out; Hex row collapse 0.35 s</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hex typing</td><td>350 ms start delay, 55 ms per letter</td></tr>
<tr><td>Bubble</td><td>enter spring 260/20 after 350 ms; leave 0.15 s (bounce +18 px, then off left); Hex follows 80 ms later, 0.2 s easeIn</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hex</td><td>ambient idle every 4 s; panel Hex enters 250 ms after the sheet, thumbs-up cue 900 ms after that, held about 2.8 s</td></tr>
<tr><td>Continue press</td><td>hold 150 ms, handler at 330 ms; shine every 5 s; electric effect 0.67 s</td></tr>
<tr><td>Picked answer</td><td>bounce [1, 0.95, 1.05, 1] in 0.4 s; press 0.97 (rows) / 0.96 (tiles)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wrong shake</td><td>x [0, -7, 7, -5, 5, 0]; 0.4 s (blocks, steps); wrong state held 800 ms (<code>WRONG_MS</code>), multi-pick 600 ms</td></tr>
<tr><td>Streak</td><td>strike delay 150 ms; strikeDuo2 0.9 s on the 2nd; strikeMix 1.6 s on the 4th; strikeLoop on the 5th for 1, 4, then 7 s; battery +1 every 3rd</td></tr>
<tr><td>Confetti, XP</td><td>120 pieces, gravity 0.35; "+10 XP" 56 px, 1.6 s</td></tr>
<tr><td>ExpressionStage</td><td>right: result pill springs 260/14, <code>done()</code> after 600 ms; placed block spring 420/22; wrong held 800 ms</td></tr>
<tr><td>ShareStage</td><td><code>done()</code> 900 ms after the round that leaves too few</td></tr>
<tr><td>FillRowsStage</td><td>chairs 0.16 s apart; count badge at per x 0.16 s; <code>done()</code> at per x 160 + 700 ms after the last row</td></tr>
<tr><td>SymbolStage</td><td><code>done()</code> 900 ms after the need-th different key; key bounce 0.35 s; card cross-fade 0.2 s</td></tr>
<tr><td>StepStage</td><td><code>done()</code> 1100 ms after the last step; dots 0.3 s</td></tr>
<tr><td>OrderStage / MultiPickStage</td><td><code>done()</code> 600 ms / 500 ms after the last right tap</td></tr>
<tr><td>Flip carousel</td><td>demo starts 700 ms after Hex finishes; back held 2400 ms; autoplay 2600 ms per card, once; slide 0.7 s <code>cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1)</code>; flip 0.5 s <code>cubic-bezier(0.45, 0, 0.25, 1)</code>, perspective 900; swipe 50 px or 400 px/s; <code>done()</code> 1600 ms after the last card is seen; card 230 x 336, step 218, side scale 0.9</td></tr>
<tr><td>Turn stages</td><td>card lit 500 ms after the stage opens; lit scale 1.04 spring 320/22; dimmed cards 30%; entrance 0.35 s, 80 ms apart</td></tr>
<tr><td>Scenes</td><td>ValueCards 0.3 s apart (spring 260/20); InfoSheet lines 0.25 s apart; WalletScene pill after 0.6 s, new total after 1.3 s; PlantGrid starts at 700 ms, 450 ms per row then column; CompareDemo symbol at 0.2 s, result at 0.7 s; GroupsPicture 0.25 s per box</td></tr>
<tr><td>Recap</td><td>boxes at 0.2 / 0.5 / 0.8 s, branch line from 1.05 s (0.5 s), outcome boxes at 1.5 and 1.65 s, list from 1.9 s (0.15 s apart)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Gem popup</td><td>3 s auto-close; reward chest Continue 1.9 s after the third tap</td></tr>
<tr><td>Out of energy</td><td>sheet 600 ms after the battery reaches 0</td></tr>
</table>

